From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] win32u: ActivateKeyboardLayout with aliased layouts

Aliased keyboard layouts (0xf000/0xe000 in the high word) activate with the
input language's character set, and UTF-8 locale data no longer gives
WM_INPUTLANGCHANGE the PC437 character set. CORE: integrator must review
(patches/notes/5217.txt).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
---

diff --git a/dlls/win32u/input.c b/dlls/win32u/input.c
--- a/dlls/win32u/input.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/input.c
@@ -1313,15 +1313,29 @@
         HWND ime_hwnd = get_default_ime_window( 0 );
         const NLS_LOCALE_DATA *data;
         CHARSETINFO cs = {0};
+        LCID lcid;
 
         if (ime_hwnd) send_message( ime_hwnd, WM_IME_INTERNAL, IME_INTERNAL_HKL_DEACTIVATE, HandleToUlong(old_layout) );
 
+        /* Stained Glass OS: an aliased layout (0xf000 | layout id, or an IME's 0xe000 one) carries
+         * no language in its high word; the character set is the input language's, its low word */
+        lcid = (HIWORD(layout) & 0x8000) ? LOWORD(layout) : HIWORD(layout);
+#ifdef SG_MUTANT_HKL_ALIAS_FIXME
         if (HIWORD(layout) & 0x8000)
             FIXME( "Aliased keyboard layout not yet implemented\n" );
-        else if (!(data = get_locale_data( HIWORD(layout) )))
-            WARN( "Failed to find locale data for %04x\n", HIWORD(layout) );
         else
-            translate_charset_info( ULongToPtr(data->idefaultansicodepage), &cs, TCI_SRCCODEPAGE );
+#endif
+        if (!(data = get_locale_data( lcid )))
+            WARN( "Failed to find locale data for %04x\n", lcid );
+        else
+        {
+            /* a locale whose ANSI code page is UTF-8 (all of them here) uses the process's ANSI one */
+            UINT cp = data->idefaultansicodepage == CP_UTF8 ? ansi_cp.CodePage : data->idefaultansicodepage;
+#ifdef SG_MUTANT_HKL_UTF8
+            cp = data->idefaultansicodepage;
+#endif
+            translate_charset_info( ULongToPtr(cp), &cs, TCI_SRCCODEPAGE );
+        }
 
         info->kbd_layout = layout;
         info->kbd_layout_id = 0;
